    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, a striker gains the ability to break through even the hardiest of foes. A striker ignores up to 2 points of damage reduction or hardness whenever she makes an attack with an unarmed strike. At 6th level and every 3 levels thereafter, she can ignore an additional 1 point of damage reduction or hardness.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/striker#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
